    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the thing is, i don't think there's anything else. i've spent my entire life building this one thing. now that it's done, there's just no momentum left. i feel like i've finished the story and there's nothing left for the next chapter. it's just... quiet. and exhausting. like i've run out of reasons to keep going.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
